<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-515] Hadoop libraries in ${HADOOP_HOME}/share folder not included in CLASSPATH</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-515</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Below line adds the libraries to classpath&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/blob/master/bin/interpreter.sh#L90&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/blob/master/bin/interpreter.sh#L90&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;But in the method addEachJarInDir looks libraries only at the first level&lt;br/&gt;
Ref: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/svignesh/incubator-zeppelin/blob/master/bin/common.sh#L65&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/svignesh/incubator-zeppelin/blob/master/bin/common.sh#L65&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Hadoop libraries are located at level 3&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;share/hadoop/common/hadoop-common-2.6.2-tests.jar&lt;br/&gt;
share/hadoop/common/hadoop-common-2.6.2.jar&lt;br/&gt;
share/hadoop/common/hadoop-nfs-2.6.2.jar&lt;br/&gt;
share/hadoop/common/lib/activation-1.1.jar&lt;br/&gt;
share/hadoop/common/lib/apacheds-i18n-2.0.0-M15.jar&lt;br/&gt;
share/hadoop/common/lib/apacheds-kerberos-codec-2.0.0-M15.jar&lt;br/&gt;
share/hadoop/common/lib/api-asn1-api-1.0.0-M20.jar&lt;/p&gt;</description>
